{# The keys of the *🗂 Events* tab in the ⌨ panel's *More keys*: those of the card of an
   event made from the index (0574), its buttons' letters kept out of their labels.
   Delete sets aside, as on every tile page. #}
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>N</kbd> <kbd>P</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("next or previous event (its ← → buttons): skipped, it stays to decide") }}</dd>
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>U</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("next event to decide") }}</dd>
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>M</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("Sort here now: move its files to the folder said, then the next event") }}</dd>
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>O</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("Another folder…: the photos picked, else the whole event") }}</dd>
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("Do not sort this event: its files stay where they are") }}</dd>
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>T</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("Undo my choice: the event is to decide again") }}</dd>
    <dt>🗂 <kbd>⌫</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("take the picked files back out of the set aside") }}</dd>
